{"id":"a3-u04","level":"a3","order":4,"title":{"en":"Politics","fr":"La politique","es":"La política","ar":"السياسة"},"tip":{"en":"Political language is built on contrast: the government and the opposition, the majority and the minority, a promise and its result. Learn the institutions first, then the verbs that describe what they do: approve, block, reform, resign.","fr":"Le langage politique repose sur le contraste : le gouvernement et l'opposition, la majorité et la minorité, une promesse et son résultat. Apprenez d'abord les institutions, puis les verbes qui décrivent leur action : adopter, bloquer, réformer, démissionner.","es":"El lenguaje político se basa en el contraste: el gobierno y la oposición, la mayoría y la minoría, una promesa y su resultado. Aprende primero las instituciones y luego los verbos que describen lo que hacen: aprobar, bloquear, reformar, dimitir.","ar":"تقوم لغة السياسة على التقابل: الحكومة والمعارضة، والأغلبية والأقلية، والوعد ونتيجته. تعلم المؤسسات أولا ثم الأفعال التي تصف عملها: أقر، عرقل، أصلح، استقال."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a3-u04-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"government, parliament, president","fr":"gouvernement, parlement, président","es":"gobierno, parlamento, presidente","ar":"حكومة، برلمان، رئيس"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u04-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"election, vote, candidate","fr":"élection, vote, candidat","es":"elección, voto, candidato","ar":"انتخابات، صوت، مرشح"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"coalition, opposition, majority","fr":"coalition, opposition, majorité","es":"coalición, oposición, mayoría","ar":"ائتلاف، معارضة، أغلبية"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u04-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"bill, reform, policy","fr":"projet de loi, réforme, politique","es":"proyecto de ley, reforma, política","ar":"مشروع قانون، إصلاح، سياسة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"sovereignty, citizen, rights","fr":"souveraineté, citoyen, droits","es":"soberanía, ciudadano, derechos","ar":"سيادة، مواطن، حقوق"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u04-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"judge, corruption, budget","fr":"juge, corruption, budget","es":"juez, corrupción, presupuesto","ar":"قاض، فساد، ميزانية"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"diplomacy, treaty, sanction","fr":"diplomatie, traité, sanction","es":"diplomacia, tratado, sanción","ar":"دبلوماسية، معاهدة، عقوبات"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u04-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"protest, strike, rhetoric","fr":"manifestation, grève, rhétorique","es":"manifestación, huelga, retórica","ar":"احتجاج، إضراب، خطابة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"propaganda, populism, promise","fr":"propagande, populisme, promesse","es":"propaganda, populismo, promesa","ar":"دعاية، شعبوية، وعد"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l10","type":"learn","order":10,"title":{"en":"spokesperson, resign, veto","fr":"porte-parole, démissionner, veto","es":"portavoz, dimitir, veto","ar":"متحدث رسمي، استقال، حق النقض"},"count":9},{"id":"a3-u04-l11","type":"story","order":11,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u04-l12","type":"review","order":12,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
